          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanshi ulya mwanakashi ine nkamusembeleka no kumutwala mu matololo, emo nkaya landa kuli ena amashiwi yamutembo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.7.24+JOS.7.25+JOS.7.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yosh 7:24-26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ine nkamubwesesha amabala yakwe aya myangashi, ne shika lya Ako",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2:15",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "ishika lya Ako:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ishina “ishika lya Ako” lyapilibulwa ukutila, “ishika lya busanso” (Yosh 7:1-26).",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " akausangula impongolo iyakulolelapo ifisuma. Emo akalanjasukila nga filya fine alenjasuka ilyo ali umukashana, pa nshita afumine mu calo ca Egupto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Efyasosa Yawe ati, “Pa bushiku bulya, ukalanjita ati, ‘Mulume wandi,’ tawakalenjita nakabili ati, ‘Shikulu wandi",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2:16",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Shikulu wandi:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Mu Cihibulu ili shiwi lipilibula ukuti “Baali wandi.”",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ",’ iyoo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkafumya mu kanwa kakwe amashina ya imilungu ba Baali, ine nshakaleke akalelumbula amashina yaiko nakabili iyoo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.2.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
